[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/Dazed-Workshop/main/Hordes/images/banner.jpg?v=2[/img]

[b]A staff and debug test, not for normal play.[/b] Dazed Hordes is planned as a recurring, readable threat that goes after a base worth attacking, without hurting server performance. This build only measures the cost.

[table]
[tr][td][b]Game version[/b][/td][td]Build 42 only (42.0+)[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Requires[/b][/td][td][b]Dazed Core[/b] (subscribe to it too)[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Multiplayer[/b][/td][td]Untested[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Mod ID[/b][/td][td]DazedHordesTest[/td][/tr]
[/table]

[h2]What the test does[/h2]
[list]
[*]Spawns 50, 150 or 300 zombies out of sight and steers them to you.
[*]Marks the horde and its checkpoints on the map.
[*]Logs server tick and client frame cost to console.txt.
[/list]

[i]Mod ID: DazedHordesTest · Version 0.3.1[/i]
